# Cyclopean Tomb: "{2}, {T}: Put a mire counter on target non-Swamp land. That land is a Swamp for as long as it has a mire counter
# on it. Activate only during your upkeep." Not offered in Bot1's main phase (the same position, with mana to spare, as the
# upkeep); in the upkeep Bot2's Swamp is refused and Bot1's Forest takes the counter, paid for with exactly {2} (CC from the
# Sol Ring), and becomes a Swamp: its Forest type and {G} gone, tapping for {B} (CR 305.7, 611.2b, 605.1a).
